{
  "_comment": [
    "Built-in approximations for blocks that do not exist in 1.12.2.",
    "Each entry keeps a block that would otherwise become air, by substituting the closest block 1.12.2 does have.",
    "Rules of thumb used when choosing a substitute:",
    "  1. Same shape beats same colour - a stairs stays a stairs, a wall stays a wall, a trapdoor stays a trapdoor.",
    "  2. Same material family next - a wood becomes the nearest wood, a deepslate ore becomes its overworld ore.",
    "  3. Colour is matched only within the same shape.",
    "Anything not listed here still becomes air, and is still listed in the conversion report.",
    "User mappings always take precedence over these: the mapping file keeps the earliest matching entry."
  ],
